      "widgets_values": [
        "Qwen Image Edit 2511 — Custom + Optional LoRA Stack\n\nRequired: Lightning 4-step is always enabled.\nOptional LoRAs are installed as separate chained nodes and start in BYPASS mode.\nEnable only the LoRA(s) you need and tune each strength independently.\n\nOptional chain: Ultra Portrait → Hyper Portrait → Anything2Real → SexGod → MCNL-NSFW-v1 → Custom.\n\nFace Guard v6:\n- This workflow now includes an active post-process identity branch: ReActor face restore + FaceDetailer cleanup.\n- Identity anchor is restored after the main Qwen edit to reduce face drift.\n- If the subject is not a human face, bypass the Face Guard nodes.\n"
