      "title": "Face Guard v6 — ReActor + FaceDetailer",
      "widgets_values": [
        "Face Guard v6 — Real face-preservation stack\n\nActive branch added to this workflow:\nQwen output → ReActor face restore → FaceDetailer cleanup → SaveImage\n\nIdentity anchor for this workflow: Image 1.\nUse this branch when you are editing a human subject and want stronger face consistency.\nIf this workflow is used for a non-human image or no face is present, you can bypass ReActor and/or FaceDetailer in ComfyUI.\n\nInstalled helper nodes required:\n- ComfyUI-ReActor\n- ComfyUI-Impact-Pack\n- ComfyUI-Impact-Subpack (for UltralyticsDetectorProvider)\n"
